/tmp/paper2502.14794.v8II3G/Hamilton_paper.tex:1572:\subsection{Reconstruction from a smoothed fragment}
/tmp/paper2502.14794.v8II3G/Hamilton_paper.tex:1573:\label{sc:smoothed_reconstruction}
