+        "solver faces essentially all cyclic permutations."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Theorem 1.7 gives the sharp regime "
+        "p=(1+o(1))*sqrt(e/n) for squares of Hamilton cycles; at the shipping "
+        "preset n=96 and actual density 0.171711 (factor 1.02), no polynomial "
